      "slug": "brick-system-route-checker",
      "name": "Brick Motor & Sensor System Route Checker",
      "h1": "Can this motor or sensor cross LEGO system generations?",
      "description": "Compare Power Functions, Powered Up/LPF2 and NXT/EV3 connection families before reusing a motor, light or sensor. Software functionality remains separate.",
